# Bargained (CR 702.166a: Mox Pearl is sacrificed), Stonesplitter Bolt deals twice X damage: X = 2 is 4 damage, killing
# Keen-Eyed Curator (3/3). Bargain does not change the cost: {2}{R} is still paid by Mox Ruby, Mox Jet and a Mountain,
# and a Mountain is not an artifact, enchantment or token, so it is refused as the sacrifice.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mountain
Stonesplitter Bolt
Mountain x2
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Forest
Keen-Eyed Curator
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Keen-Eyed Curator.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Stonesplitter Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Keen-Eyed Curator; X: 2)
Bot1.Modes(Bargain:)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
! Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Pearl)
? Bot1.Mana = 
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Keen-Eyed Curator
Bot1.Graveyard = Stonesplitter Bolt; Mox Pearl
